<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>BrightSteps Labs, LLC</title>
<meta name="description" content="BrightSteps Labs, LLC creates thoughtful technology to help families connect, encourage growth, and celebrate everyday progress. Meet Benny's Encouragements.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="data:image/jpeg;base64,">
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: "Segoe UI", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
         background: #F4F9FD; color: #123C5C; line-height: 1.55; }
  .band { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #35A6E8, #1D7FC1); color: #fff;
          text-align: center; padding: 56px 20px 48px; }
  .band h1 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .2px; }
  .band h1 .llc { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; opacity: .85; }
  .band p { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 10px; color: #FFE9A8; font-weight: 600; }
  .wrap { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 36px 20px 12px; }
  .intro { font-size: 18px; text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 34px; }
  .label { text-align: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px;
           text-transform: uppercase; color: #1D7FC1; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .product { background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(18,60,92,.12);
             padding: 28px; display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center; }
  .product img { width: 210px; height: 210px; border-radius: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .product h2 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .product p { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .btns { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;
         padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .btn-primary { background: #FFC93C; color: #123C5C; }
  .btn-outline { border: 2px solid #1D7FC1; color: #1D7FC1; }
  .values { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin: 34px 0 8px; }
  .value { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px;
           box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(18,60,92,.08); }
  .value h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .value h3 .star { color: #F5A800; }
  .value p { font-size: 14.5px; color: #3D6076; }
  .contact { text-align: center; padding: 30px 10px 6px; }
  .contact p { font-size: 17px; }
  .contact a { color: #1D7FC1; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  footer { text-align: center; color: #6B8AA0; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 26px 20px 34px; }
  footer div + div { margin-top: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .band h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    .band p { font-size: 17px; }
    .product { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 24px 20px; }
    .btns { justify-content: center; }
    .values { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .band .company-logo { display: block; width: min(420px, 100%); height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1.55; object-fit: cover; margin: 0 auto 18px; border-radius: 20px; }
  /* Refined typography: native fonts keep this page self-contained. */
  body { line-height: 1.65; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  .band p { font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: -.2px; max-width: 680px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .intro { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.75; color: #3D6076; }
  .label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.6px; }
  .product h2 { font-size: 29px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.65px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .product p { line-height: 1.7; }
  .product p strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .btn { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; }
  .value h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: -.2px; margin-bottom: 9px; }
  .value p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .contact p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .contact a { font-weight: 600; }
  footer { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.65; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .intro { font-size: 17px; }
    .product h2 { font-size: 27px; }
  }
  /* A quieter parent-company identity. */
  .band { background: #fff; color: #123C5C; padding: 42px 20px 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #DFEAF1; }
  .band .company-logo { width: min(520px, 100%); height: auto; aspect-ratio: auto; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 0; margin: 0 auto 20px; }
  .band p { color: #3D6076; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 400; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .band { padding: 30px 20px 26px; } .band p { font-size: 17px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="band">
  <h1><img class="company-logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="BrightSteps Labs, LLC" width="2172" height="724"></h1>
  <p>Helping Families Grow, One Encouraging Moment at a Time</p>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <p class="intro">Founded by Larry Graiber in Illinois, BrightSteps Labs creates thoughtful technology
  that helps families connect, build confidence, and celebrate everyday progress. We believe
  small moments of encouragement can make a meaningful difference in a child’s day.</p>

  <div class="label">Our first product</div>
  <section class="product">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Benny, a cheerful beaver in a green hoodie and cap, waving">
    <div>
      <h2>Benny's Encouragements</h2>
      <p><strong>Little Words. Big Confidence. Brighter Days.</strong></p>
      <p>Benny helps parents bring more encouragement into everyday family life with positive
      messages, star rewards for chores and healthy habits, and gentle support for navigating
      big feelings. Celebrate small wins and make each encouraging moment count.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://bennyapp.net">Meet Benny</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://app.bennyapp.net">Open the app</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="values">
    <div class="value">
      <h3><span class="star">★</span> Thoughtfully designed</h3>
      <p>We value clear, simple experiences that help parents encourage and support their children.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <h3><span class="star">★</span> Encouragement first</h3>
      <p>Our focus is on meaningful family moments, positive habits, and celebrating progress one step at a time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <h3><span class="star">★</span> Inspired by family</h3>
      <p>Created by a parent and inspired by his own family, Benny brings a personal perspective to everyday encouragement.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact">
    <p>Let’s connect.<br>For business, media, and partnership inquiries:<br>
    <a href="mailto:hello@bennyapp.net">hello@bennyapp.net</a></p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div>© 2026 BrightSteps Labs, LLC · Illinois</div>
  <div>Benny's Encouragements is a product of BrightSteps Labs, LLC.</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
